.IP \(bu 2.3
.\}
Print the raw persistent event log of an established context to a file:
.sp
.if n \{\
.RS 4
.\}
.nf
# nvme ocp persistent\-event\-log /dev/nvme0 \-\-action=0 \-\-raw\-binary > persistent_log\&.raw
.fi
.if n \{\
.RE
.\}
.sp
